  m_text: "Guards will chase after Momo if they detect \nher. By pressing            
    Momo will release a \nthick  shadowy smoke to cover herself in \nshadow and to
    hide herself from the guards.\nThis strong ability is rechargable only after\ntotal
    fading or after a binding to a ritual site."
